        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umělá inteligence a meze kontroly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI cannot lower the score below a danger proven by the on-device rules. You always make the final decision before anything opens or is handed to another app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI cannot lower the score below a danger proven by the on-device rules. You always make the final decision before anything opens or is handed to another app."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umělá inteligence nesmí snížit skóre pod hranici rizika prokázaného pravidly v iPhonu. O otevření odkazu nebo předání jiné aplikaci vždy rozhodujete vy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI combines website, surroundings and known-scam evidence. It can miss a scam or wrongly flag an honest code. The result explains its reasons and what could not be checked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI combines website, surroundings and known-scam evidence. It can miss a scam or wrongly flag an honest code. The result explains its reasons and what could not be checked."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umělá inteligence spojuje zjištění z webu, okolí kódu a známých podvodů. Může podvod přehlédnout nebo neprávem označit poctivý kód. U výsledku najdete důvody i to, co se nepodařilo ověřit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI used in this check": {
