    "Deep checks run on Safe QR servers in AWS Frankfurt, in the EU. Photos are analysed in memory and never stored. Check records expire after 24 hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deep checks run on Safe QR servers in AWS Frankfurt, in the EU. Photos are analysed in memory and never stored. Check records expire after 24 hours."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podrobné kontroly probíhají na serverech Safe QR v AWS ve Frankfurtu, v EU. Fotky se zpracují v paměti a nikdy se neukládají. Záznamy kontrol vyprší po 24 hodinách."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deep checks send the link and a photo of its surroundings to Safe QR servers in the EU. A photo check may also send payment details from the code. Photos are never stored. Results use AI and can be wrong.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deep checks send the link and a photo of its surroundings to Safe QR servers in the EU. A photo check may also send payment details from the code. Photos are never stored. Results use AI and can be wrong."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podrobná kontrola odešle odkaz a fotku okolí na servery Safe QR v EU. Při kontrole fotky může odeslat i platební údaje z kódu. Fotky se nikdy neukládají. Výsledky využívají umělou inteligenci a mohou být chybné."
          }
        }
      }
    },
